WEBVTT

00:26:58.030 --> 00:27:01.296
Our highest-quality connections
are often with friends at work,

00:27:01.320 --> 00:27:04.213
and research has shed light
on just how many friends you need

00:27:04.237 --> 00:27:06.046
in order to not feel lonely.

00:27:06.070 --> 00:27:07.596
Any guesses?

00:27:07.620 --> 00:27:08.966
It's one.

00:27:08.990 --> 00:27:10.636
One work friend.

00:27:10.660 --> 00:27:14.326
Just one person who you feel
connected to and understood by.

00:27:14.350 --> 00:27:17.106
One person to share some
ups and downs with at work.

00:27:17.130 --> 00:27:18.561
That's all it takes.

00:27:19.230 --> 00:27:22.886
But Jane's research suggests that
a relationship doesn't have to be lasting

00:27:22.910 --> 00:27:24.653
to create a high-quality connection.

00:27:24.677 --> 00:27:26.926
You can experience it
in a momentary interaction

00:27:26.950 --> 00:27:28.785
with someone you don't know very well,

00:27:28.809 --> 00:27:31.176
a distant coworker or even a stranger,